    }
  ]
}
```

## Automation Features

### 1. Auto-Assignment
```bash
# Automatically assign cards to agents
npx claude-flow@v3alpha github board-auto-assign \
  --strategy "load-balanced" \
  --consider "expertise,workload,availability" \
  --update-cards
```

### 2. Progress Tracking
