# Determine next version
npx ruv-swarm github version-suggest \
  --current v1.2.3 \
  --analyze-commits \
  --check-compatibility \
  --suggest-pre-release
```

**Logic:**
- Analyzes commit messages
- Detects breaking changes
- Suggests appropriate bump
